From: Matthew Gibson <mgibson041387@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:08:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Add automatic backup settings to the backups page

New 'Automatic Backups' section on the dashboard backups page for the
scheduled backup task: retention count and backup content, saved to the
scheduledbackup configuration store.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
